 </div>
 <div class="type-sample">
 <p class="sample-text type-step" data-step="section">Section title - Outfit</p>
 <code class="type-info">font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: var(--text-section) (clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem))</code>
 </div>
 <div class="type-sample">
 <p class="sample-text type-step" data-step="base">Body text - Regular paragraph content with proper line height for optimal readability across devices.</p>
 <code class="type-info">font-size: var(--text-base) (1rem), line-height: 1.6</code>
 </div>
 <div class="type-sample">
